---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="EUROCERT | Albert Heijn"
  description="Albert Heijn supplier certification - evidence of food safety, quality and sustainability for one of Europe's leading supermarket chains."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.eurocert.asia/food-certification/albert-heijn/"
  ogImage="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367859/eurocert/Untitled_design_19_.png.png"
  keywords="Eurocert,Eurocert Asia,ISO certification,CE marking,food safety certification,FSSC 22000,BRCGS,GFSI,social audits,Sedex,SMETA,SA8000,inspection services,certification body,India,management systems,ISO 9001,ISO 14001,ISO 45001"
>
<style is:global>@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:900;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-solid-900.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Brands";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-brands-400.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-regular-400.woff2) format('woff2')}</style>
<section class="relative min-h-[55vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367604/eurocert/F11.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-30" alt="Albert Heijn"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030a16]/70 via-[#030a16]/40 to-[#030a16]"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-20"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 bg-eurogold-400/5 mb-6"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400 animate-pulse"></span><span class="heading-font text-[10px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-bold">Leading Dutch Supermarket Supplier Standards</span></div><h1 class="heading-font text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-white mb-3 tracking-tight" style="text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(212,168,67,0.3)">Albert Heijn<!-- --> <span class="text-eurogold-400">Certification</span></h1><p class="text-white/90 text-sm md:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">Meet the quality and safety requirements of Albert Heijn - the Netherlands&#x27; leading supermarket chain. Qualify as an approved supplier and access their extensive retail network.</p></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 items-start"><div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-6"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Standard Overview</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">Albert Heijn<!-- --> <span class="text-euro-600">Certification</span></h2></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Albert Heijn is the largest supermarket chain in the Netherlands, with a strong reputation for quality and food safety. Suppliers wishing to supply Albert Heijn must meet their specific quality, safety, and sustainability requirements. These standards often build on GFSI-benchmarked schemes such as GLOBALGAP and BRCGS, with additional retailer-specific criteria.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Eurocert Asia supports suppliers seeking Albert Heijn approval with certification services, gap assessments, and compliance guidance. We help you navigate the requirements and demonstrate your capability to meet the high standards expected by one of Europe&#x27;s leading retailers.</p><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/40"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-info-circle text-white text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">What is Albert Heijn Certification?</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Albert Heijn certification refers to the process of meeting and demonstrating compliance with Albert Heijn&#x27;s supplier quality and safety standards. Requirements typically include food safety certification (e.g., BRCGS, IFS, FSSC 22000), quality management, traceability, and for fresh produce often GLOBALGAP with add-ons such as AH DLL Grow. Certification validates that your operation meets the retailer&#x27;s expectations for product safety, quality, and supply chain integrity.</p></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-2 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-100 flex h-[320px] md:h-[400px] group"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367604/eurocert/F11.png.png" class="w-full h-full transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105 object-cover" alt="Albert Heijn"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/20 via-transparent to-transparent"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Our Albert Heijn Services</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Albert Heijn<!-- --> <span class="text-euro-600">Certification Support</span></h2><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-3 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">Comprehensive Supplier Certification Solutions for Dutch Retail</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-certificate text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Supplier Certification</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Complete certification services to qualify as an approved Albert Heijn supplier, meeting all quality and safety requirements for their retail network.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Quality Standards Compliance</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Comprehensive assessment and verification of your quality management systems to ensure they meet Albert Heijn&#x27;s stringent supplier standards.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Food Safety Verification</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Thorough food safety verification covering production, handling, storage, and distribution to meet Albert Heijn requirements.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-truck text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Supply Chain Audit</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Detailed supply chain audits to verify traceability, product integrity, and compliance throughout your operations.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-file-alt text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Documentation Support</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Assistance with supplier documentation, quality records, and compliance paperwork required for approval.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-sync-alt text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Compliance Monitoring</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Ongoing monitoring and support to maintain your Albert Heijn supplier status and adapt to evolving requirements.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Certification Benefits</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Benefits of <span class="text-euro-600">Albert Heijn Certification</span></h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-store text-sm"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-1">Retailer Access</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Access to Albert Heijn&#x27;s extensive retail network across the Netherlands and beyond.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-award text-sm"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-1">Quality Assurance</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Meet high quality and safety standards required by one of Europe&#x27;s leading supermarket chains.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-handshake text-sm"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-1">Supply Chain Trust</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Build trust with a major retailer and strengthen your position in the European food supply chain.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-chart-line text-sm"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-1">Market Expansion</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Grow your business by partnering with a retailer with significant market share and consumer loyalty.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-sm"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-1">Brand Compliance</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Demonstrate alignment with Albert Heijn&#x27;s brand values and quality expectations.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,rgba(212,168,67,0.06)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Trusted Certification Partner</h4><h3 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Why Choose Eurocert for <span class="text-eurogold-400">Albert Heijn<!-- -->?</span></h3></div><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8"><div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-certificate text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">Expert Certification</h4></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">Our auditors understand Albert Heijn requirements and the certification schemes that support them. We provide gap assessments, implementation guidance, and certification audits to help you achieve supplier approval. We focus on practical, sustainable compliance rather than one-time fixes.</p></div><div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-globe-asia text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">Why Eurocert Asia?</h4></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">Eurocert Asia offers integrated support for Albert Heijn supplier certification, including GLOBALGAP, BRCGS, and AH-specific add-ons. Our European connections and local expertise ensure you receive responsive, knowledgeable support throughout your certification journey.</p></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mt-6"><div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-3xl block mb-1 leading-none">49</span><span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white/50 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Countries</span></div><div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-3xl block mb-1 leading-none">25+</span><span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white/50 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Years Experience</span></div><div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-3xl block mb-1 leading-none">ACCREDITED</span><span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white/50 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] heading-font"><a href="/accreditations/" class="hover:text-eurogold-400 transition-colors">Independent Third-Party Audits</a></span></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class="bg-[#f8fafc] py-10 lg:py-12"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"></div></div><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-8"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Explore More</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Related Certifications</h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-4xl mx-auto"><a class="group relative h-[280px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 hover:border-euro-300 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500" href="/food-certification/globalgap/"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="background-image:url(&#x27;https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367659/eurocert/F2.png.png&#x27;)"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16]/80 via-[#030a16]/20 to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5 z-20"><h4 class="text-white text-sm heading-font font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">GLOBALGAP</h4><span class="text-[9px] font-bold uppercase text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Farm Assurance</span></div></a><a class="group relative h-[280px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 hover:border-euro-300 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500" href="/food-certification/ah-dll-grow/"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="background-image:url(&#x27;https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367615/eurocert/F13.png.png&#x27;)"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16]/80 via-[#030a16]/20 to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5 z-20"><h4 class="text-white text-sm heading-font font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">AH DLL Grow Add-On</h4><span class="text-[9px] font-bold uppercase text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Albert Heijn Produce</span></div></a><a class="group relative h-[280px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 hover:border-euro-300 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500" href="/food-certification/brc/"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="background-image:url(&#x27;https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367620/eurocert/F14.png.png&#x27;)"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16]/80 via-[#030a16]/20 to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5 z-20"><h4 class="text-white text-sm heading-font font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">BRCGS</h4><span class="text-[9px] font-bold uppercase text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Brand Reputation through Compliance Global Standards</span></div></a></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_bottom,rgba(212,168,67,0.06)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 text-center"><div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto p-10 sm:p-12 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-3 font-bold">Get Certified</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-4">Start Your <!-- -->Albert Heijn<!-- --> Journey</h2><p class="text-white/45 mb-6 max-w-lg mx-auto text-sm leading-relaxed">Start your Albert Heijn certification journey. Our retail certification experts are ready to help you qualify as an approved supplier.</p><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 justify-center"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#030a16] bg-eurogold-400 rounded-full px-8 py-3.5 hover:bg-eurogold-300 transition-all shadow-lg shadow-eurogold-400/20" href="/contact/">Get Started <i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[9px]"></i></a><a href="tel:+919316012883" class="inline-flex